1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,390
(Howard:)I think it's weird.

2
00:00:01,388 --> 00:00:02,418
(Bernadette:)Howie?

3
00:00:02,422 --> 00:00:03,752
(Howard:)It is. He's a grown man.

4
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:05,327
(Howard:)He's just gonna
live there rent-free?

5
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:06,695
(Howard:)How is that gonna motivate him

6
00:00:06,693 --> 00:00:08,693
(Howard:)to get off his butt
and get a job?

7
00:00:08,695 --> 00:00:11,665
(Howard:)I mean, do you even have a plan?

8
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:14,165
(Stuart:)Hey, you're not my father, okay?

9
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:16,437
(Stuart:)And besides, your mother
and I were talking...

10
00:00:16,436 --> 00:00:18,406
"Your mother and I"?
You're not my father!

11
00:00:18,405 --> 00:00:19,635
I didn't say I was your father!

12
00:00:19,639 --> 00:00:20,709
(Howard:)Well, I didn't say

13
00:00:20,707 --> 00:00:22,507
I was your father!
Okay, calm down.

14
00:00:22,509 --> 00:00:24,409
(Bernadette:)You're not his father,
he's not your father!

15
00:00:24,411 --> 00:00:27,281
(Bernadette:)Nobody's anybody's father.

16
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,950
I-I'm sorry
you don't like my life choices,

17
00:00:28,949 --> 00:00:30,449
but it's my life!

18
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:32,620
(Howard:)Well, it's my house,
it's my rules!

19
00:00:32,619 --> 00:00:34,719
Oh-oh! Okay, Dad!

20
00:00:34,721 --> 00:00:37,321
(Stuart:)If I mow the lawn,
can I have my allowance?

21
00:00:37,324 --> 00:00:39,424
(Bernadette:)Hey, don't you take that
sarcastic tone with him!

22
00:00:39,426 --> 00:00:40,796
(Sheldon:)I don't have
to listen to you!

23
00:00:40,794 --> 00:00:42,024
Don't talk to her like that!

24
00:00:42,028 --> 00:00:43,598
That is my mother... Wife!

25
00:00:43,597 --> 00:00:45,497
My wife! I said my wife!

26
00:00:45,498 --> 00:00:47,198
(Raj:)You know what?

27
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,600
(Stuart:)This isn't getting us anywhere.

28
00:00:48,602 --> 00:00:51,272
(Stuart:)When you're ready to apologize,
you know where to find me.

29
00:00:51,271 --> 00:00:53,501
Well, yeah, in my house!

30
00:00:53,506 --> 00:00:55,576
That's right, sucka!

31
00:00:58,778 --> 00:01:01,308
(Sheldon:)I wish I'd never
gone on that trip.

